      "plain": "Scoring damage instances and kills progress a Counter, which grants stacks of Field Test at the 5 | 15 | 35 | 65 | 100 point thresholds, up to a maximum of 5 stacks at 100 points. \n\nPoints x Damage Instance | Primary Weapons = +0.1 | Grenade Launchers = +0.2 | Sword = +0.5 | Special Weapons = +0.8\nPoints x Kill | RnF Combatants = +0.5 | Elite+ = +2 | Guardians = +5\n\nField Test grants up to +20 ↑+22 Range, +40 ↑+44 Stability, +50 ↑+55 Handling, and +50 ↑+55 Reload Speed. \nSwords are granted Guard Resistance (Stability) and +Charge Rate (Handling).\nBuff is only removed on death.\n\nField Test x1 at 5 Points | +2 Range, +4 Stability, +5 Handling, and +5 Reload Speed.\nField Test x2 at 15 Points | +4 Range, +8 Stability, +10 Handling, and +10 Reload Speed.\nField Test x1 at 35 Points | +8 Range, +16 Stability, +20 Handling, and +20 Reload Speed.\nField Test x1 at 65 Points | +14 Range, +28 Stability, +35 Handling, and +35 Reload Speed.\nField Test x1 at 100 Points | +20 Range, +40 Stability, +50 Handling, and +50 Reload Speed.\n↑Stat Increases are increased by 10%.",
